      "writtenOn": "2025-07-07T20:05:02Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "General question, was there a reason that we didn\u0027t extend the existing `TextureFormatTest` class which already has a lot of utilities to do these kinds of test? If it\u0027s just because of trying to split into multiple files, maybe we could add a header and factor common stuff out? It feels wasteful to not reuse some of the utilities we created there.",
