        "id": 4024649
      },
      "writtenOn": "2025-07-08T05:47:24Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "The TextureFormatTest focuses on basic texture sampling and rendering precision. Extending it for the distinct TextureFormatsTier1 capabilities—like render attachment, blending, multisampling with resolve, and storage binding—would reduce test clarity and maintainability due to their unique pipeline, render pass and validation requirements.",
      "parentUuid": "279a2430_d83a2ba0",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 77,
        "startChar": 39,
        "endLine": 77,
        "endChar": 47
      },
      "revId": "56e8f003a5aa81171313cca81fbb8fdbcabf2ba3",
      "serverId": "dd02978d-1a8e-36d7-bcc0-a5723e5c0abd"
    },
    {
